        <h2>Summary / Description</h2>
        <div class="description">
          Virulence and persistence studies using RWV-cultured 
B. multivorans and the human surrogate host, Caenorhabditis elegans.
<p>
Virulence Experiment 1. These are the raw and processed data for the first biological replicate (of two) of a virulence study performed with wild type C. elegans as the host (N2 Bristol strain) and an ISS potable water isolate, B. multivorans, that had been cultured in the Rotating Wall Vessel (RWV) bioreactor to stationary phase prior to infection. E. coli strain OP50 served as a non-pathogenic control. Samples are labeled with a number (-1, -2, -3), representing technical replicates within the experiment (individual wells). See the "Experimental Detail" tab for additional detail. Note: two additional OP50 technical replicates are not shown due to their exclusion from the trial due to potential contamination. 
<p>
Virulence Experiment 2. This is the raw and processed data for the second biological replicate (of two) of a virulence study performed with wild type C. elegans as the host (N2 Bristol strain) and an ISS potable water isolate, B. multivorans, that had been cultured in the Rotating Wall Vessel (RWV) bioreactor to stationary phase prior to infection. E. coli strain OP50 served as a non-pathogenic control.  Samples are labeled with a number (-1, -2, -3), representing technical replicates within the experiment (individual wells). See the "Experimental Detail" tab for additional detail. 
<p>
Virulence Experiment 3. These are the raw and processed data for the first biological replicate (of two) of a virulence study performed with the ?pmk-1 mutant strain of C. elegans as the host and an ISS potable water isolate, B. multivorans that had been cultured in the Rotating Wall Vessel (RWV) bioreactor to stationary phase prior to infection. Samples are labeled with a number (-1, -2, -3), representing technical replicates within the experiment (individual wells). See the "Experimental Detail" tab for additional detail. No OP50 control was used in this test. 
<p>
Virulence Experiment 4. These are the raw and processed data for the second biological replicate (of two) of a virulence study performed with the ?pmk-1 mutant strain of C. elegans as the host and an ISS potable water isolate, B. multivorans that had been cultured in the Rotating Wall Vessel (RWV) bioreactor to stationary phase prior to infection. Samples are labeled with a number (-1, -2, -3), representing technical replicates within the experiment (individual wells). See the "Experimental Detail" tab for additional detail. No OP50 control was used in this test.
        </div>

